IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. RECONCILE.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 N PIC 99.
01 I PIC 99.
01 TRANS-ID PIC X(10).
01 AMOUNT PIC 9(7).
01 TOTAL PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01 COUNT-REC PIC 99 VALUE 0.
01 EXP-COUNT PIC 99.
01 EXP-TOTAL PIC 9(9).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    DISPLAY "ENTER NUMBER OF RECORDS:"
    ACCEPT N

    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1
        UNTIL I > N

        DISPLAY "ENTER TRANSACTION ID:"
        ACCEPT TRANS-ID

        DISPLAY "ENTER AMOUNT:"
        ACCEPT AMOUNT

        ADD AMOUNT TO TOTAL
        ADD 1 TO COUNT-REC

    END-PERFORM

    DISPLAY "ENTER EXPECTED COUNT:"
    ACCEPT EXP-COUNT

    DISPLAY "ENTER EXPECTED TOTAL:"
    ACCEPT EXP-TOTAL

    DISPLAY "ACTUAL COUNT: " COUNT-REC
    DISPLAY "ACTUAL TOTAL: " TOTAL

    IF COUNT-REC = EXP-COUNT
        DISPLAY "COUNT MATCH"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "COUNT MISMATCH"
    END-IF

    IF TOTAL = EXP-TOTAL
        DISPLAY "AMOUNT MATCH"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "AMOUNT MISMATCH"
    END-IF

    STOP RUN.
